<title>CANADA: Onex, Balaclava acquire BC Sugar.</title>
<headline>Onex, Balaclava acquire BC Sugar.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Onex Corp of Toronto and privately owned Balaclava Enterprises Ltd of Vancouver said on Wednesday that 98 percent of BC Sugar Refinery Ltd's common shares had been tendered under their joint bid made July 7.</p>
<p>Onex and Balaclava said they intend to acquire the balance of shares not tendered to the offer.</p>
<p>Acquisition of the remaining shares would give Onex 75 percent ownership of BC Sugar and Balaclava 25 percent.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
